Id: misc011w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_sendmail
Fix: Allow smrsh only programs that cannot run others (no shells, no interpreters).
References: smrsh(8)
Controls: CIS 4.8; NIST CM-7; ISO 8.21; CE Secure configuration

The local sendmail.cf is using the sendmail restricted shell (smrsh)
for program delivery, but it appears to use a program which allows
the vulnerabilities discussed in `misc010w' to be exploited.
